# Forty drones report a position to the ground station's name three times, 5 s apart, every report inside its ttl when
# the last lands: 120 wires from 40 senders at one receiver. Signed, gcs is the hub, whose 256 windows and 1024 seen
# entries hold them all, so its pressure is 0 and a replay would be a duplicate; unsigned, gcs is a leaf, whose 16 and 64
# do not, and its pressure says so.
seed 41
peers 41
profile dtn
5000   telemetry
10000  telemetry
15000  telemetry
